  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "A Gu Master enters from the sub Gu and exits from the main Gu, or travels the opposite way through the same tunnel. It is often used to link two blessed lands, to send resources in peacetime, and to send reinforcements in war.",
        "chapters": [
          423
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The Gu looks like a walnut with a wooden, uneven surface, and is as large as a watermelon. Activation needs at least a rank five peak stage Gu Master using all of that Master’s primeval essence. Once planted and fed, it cannot be moved; the link waits until the matching sub Gu is activated on the other side. Feeding costs two hundred thousand primeval stones each year, and each activation also spends a large amount of primeval stones. Ordinary Gu Masters rarely keep it alone; large sects, clans, and Gu Immortals with huge resources are the usual keepers.",
        "chapters": [
          424
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-activation-and-cost",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_gu_masters",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Connecting Heaven Gu and Hole Earth Gu are only mortal Gu; blessed lands or grotto-heavens that use them silently spend heavenly power for the link. Setup needs consent from both sides so both apertures can spend that power; a secret plant without consent cannot connect. They also cannot work if set up outside in the five regions.",
        "chapters": [
          739
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "heavenly-power-and-setup",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_connecting_heaven_gu",
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
